  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Z2OD4E5J\">事件管理相关的操作手册请查阅：<a href=\"https://event-manager.oceanengine.com/docs/8650/event_manager_docs/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">事件管理操作手册</a></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-GgsCQORb\">相关链接：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-YI8H5bNH\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-6HcRCSfk\"><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/doc/index.html?key=ad&amp;type=api&amp;id=1708428054592516\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">巨量引擎转化跟踪SDK隐私政策</a></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ncFQA6Gj\"><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710646848512\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">线索-JS布码上报数据</a></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-R0mUFcgZ\"><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710647473167\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">线索-API上报数据</a></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Kfbe9Y9H\"><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710648050700\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">线索-Xpath上报数据</a></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-HP3f3iko\"><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710648621071\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">应用SDK上报数据</a></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Gc96dkPI\"><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710653463564\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">应用API上报数据</a></li></ul><hr style=\"background-color: rgb(232, 232, 232); border: 1px solid transparent; margin: 18px 0px;\"/><p data-id=\"p838747a-8U5nfEhU\">通过上报转化数据，可有效衡量营销投放效果，并且让营销系统找到更多高价值用户。根据投放目标，可分为线索和APP应用两大类： <strong>线索转化跟踪</strong>:例如希望用户提交表单、拨打电话、在线咨询等，可选择的追踪方式包括JS布码、Xpath追踪、API回传 <strong>应用转化跟踪</strong>:例如希望用户激活app、注册、购物、付费等，可选择的追踪方式包括API回传、SDK回传</p></div>",
